#: cryptographyselectuserkey.cpp:41
msgid "Select Contact's Public Key"
msgstr "Apen Slötel för Kontakt utsöken"

#: cryptographyselectuserkey.cpp:50 cryptographyselectuserkey.cpp:51
msgid "Select the key you want to use encrypt messages to the recipient"
msgstr ""
"Hier kannst Du den Slötel utsöken, mit den Du Narichten för den Adressaat "
"verslöteln wullt"

#: cryptographyselectuserkey.cpp:54
#, kde-format
msgid "Select public key for %1"
msgstr "Apen Slötel för \"%1\" utsöken"

#: cryptographypreferences.cpp:46
msgid "Private Key: "
msgstr "Privaatslötel: "

#: cryptographypreferences.cpp:49 cryptographypreferences.cpp:50
msgid "Select the key you want to use to sign and encrypt messages"
msgstr ""
"Hier kannst Du den Slötel utsöken, mit den Du Narichten ünnerschrieven un "
"verslöteln wullt"

#: cryptographypreferences.cpp:51
msgid "The private key used for decryption and signing"
msgstr "De Privaatslötel för't Ünnerschrieven un Opslöteln"

#: cryptographypreferences.cpp:52
msgid ""
"View and change the private key used for signing and encrypting messages "
"using the Cryptography plugin"
msgstr ""
"Hier kannst Du den Privaatslötel, mit den dat Verslötelmoduul Narichten "
"ünnerschrifft un verslötelt, ankieken un wesseln."

#: cryptographypreferences.cpp:54
msgid ""
"Before you can sign messages or receive encrypted ones, you must select a "
"private key for yourself.\n"
"\n"
"Before you can send encrypted messages to someone, you must select their "
"public key by right-clicking on their name in your contact list and choosing "
"\"Select Public Key\"."
msgstr ""
"Ehr Du Narichten ünnerschrieven oder verslötelt Narichten kriegen kannst, "
"muttst Du Di en Privaatslötel utsöken.\n"
"\n"
"Ehr Du verslötelt Narichten afsteed stüern kannst, muttst Du en apen Slötel "
"vun den Adressaat utsöken. Klick binnen Dien Kontaktenlist mit den rechten "
"Muusknoop op den Adressaat un bruuk \"Apen Slötel utsöken\"."

#: exportkeys.cpp:40
msgid "Export Public Keys"
msgstr "Apen Slötels exporteren"

#: exportkeys.cpp:42
msgid "Export"
msgstr "Exporteren"

#: exportkeys.cpp:42
msgid "Export checked keys to address book"
msgstr "Utsöcht Slötels na Adressbook exporteren"

#: exportkeys.cpp:75
msgid "<No meta-contacts with keys to export>"
msgstr "<Keen Metakontakten mit Slötels, de sik exporteren laat>"

#: cryptographyplugin.cpp:92
msgid "&Select Public Key..."
msgstr "&Apen Slötel utsöken..."

#: cryptographyplugin.cpp:98
msgid "&Export Public Keys To Address Book..."
msgstr "Apen Slötels na Adressbook e&xporteren..."

#: cryptographyplugin.cpp:366 cryptographyguiclient.cpp:163
msgid ""
"This protocol may not work with messages that are encrypted. This is because "
"encrypted messages are very long, and the server or peer may reject them due "
"to their length. To avoid being signed off or your account being warned or "
"temporarily suspended, turn off encryption."
msgstr ""
"Dit Protokoll funkscheneert nich jümmers mit verslötelt Narichten. "
"Verslötelt Narichten sünd recht wat lang, un de Server oder Partner wiest "
"ehr dor wegen villicht torüch. Wenn Du nich de Riskanz op Di nehmen wullt, "
"dat Du utmeldt oder vermahnt warrst oder Dien Konto för en Tiet utmaakt "
"warrt, maak dat Verslöteln man ut."

#: cryptographyplugin.cpp:367 cryptographyguiclient.cpp:164
msgid "Cryptography Unsupported Protocol"
msgstr "Protokoll ünnerstütt Verslöteln nich"

#: cryptographyplugin.cpp:403
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Cryptography plugin has found an encryption key for %1 (%2) in your KDE "
"address book. Do you want to use key %3 as this contact's public key? "
msgstr ""
"Dat Verslötelmoduul hett en Verslötel-Slötel för \"%1\" (%2) binnen Dien KDE-"
"Adressbook funnen. Wullt Du den Slötel \"%3\" as den apen Slötel vun dissen "
"Kontakt bruken? "

#: cryptographyplugin.cpp:404
msgid "Public Key Found"
msgstr "Apen Slötel funnen"

#: cryptographyplugin.cpp:415
msgid "Public Keys Found"
msgstr "Apen Slötels funnen"

#: cryptographyplugin.cpp:418
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Cryptography plugin has found multiple encryption keys for %1 (%2) in your "
"KDE address book. To use one of these keys, select it and choose OK."
msgstr ""
"Dat Verslötelmoduul hett en Reeg Verslötel-Slötels för \"%1\" (%2) binnen "
"Dien KDE-Adressbook funnen. Wenn Du dor een vun bruken wullt, söök em ut un "
"klick op \"OK\"."

